    {
      "subId": "4112714",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411271301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411271301": {
            "id": "411271301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'll help you out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411271302"
            ]
          },
          "411271302": {
            "id": "411271302",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "That's great. Now, let me think... While I can't remember the details, I was wandering around the Thousand Winds Temple earlier...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411271303"
            ]
          },
          "411271303": {
            "id": "411271303",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "But as I was running back, I encountered a large group Electro Slimes. I got careless and took a few hits from them, and the box fell out...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411271304"
            ]
          },
          "411271304": {
            "id": "411271304",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Now, I did manage to grab it back, but... I wound up losing it again in my haste.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411271305"
            ]
          },
          "411271305": {
            "id": "411271305",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Still, since the box was touched by those Electro Slimes, it should have some elemental traces on it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411271306"
            ]
          },
          "411271306": {
            "id": "411271306",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "In any case, try following the trail of Electro traces and see what you can find.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411271307"
            ]
          },
          "411271307": {
            "id": "411271307",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Once you've found the box, bring it back to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411271308"
            ]
          },
          "411271308": {
            "id": "411271308",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Well... <color=#00E1FFFF>you can also come back and look for me if you really can't find it</color>.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411271309"
            ]
          },
          "411271309": {
            "id": "411271309",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "I'll give it a bit more thought. Maybe I'll remember something..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112715",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411271401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411271401": {
            "id": "411271401",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Bit hard to search without leads, don't you think?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411271402"
            ]
          },
          "411271402": {
            "id": "411271402",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Um, alright, one moment. Let me try to remember...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411271403"
            ]
          },
          "411271403": {
            "id": "411271403",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "No, nothing comes to mind. There's nothing special about the box, either...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411271404"
            ]
          },
          "411271404": {
            "id": "411271404",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Then if I may ask you something...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411271405"
            ]
          },
          "411271405": {
            "id": "411271405",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Sure. What would you like to know?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112706",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411270401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411270401": {
            "id": "411270401",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What's in the box?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411270402"
            ]
          },
          "411270402": {
            "id": "411270402",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "That's, uh, none of your business. Just a few odds and ends...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411270403"
            ]
          },
          "411270403": {
            "id": "411270403",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Come on! Don't look at me like that. I'm not some kind of villain!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411270404"
            ]
          },
          "411270404": {
            "id": "411270404",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But you're with the Fatui.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411270405"
            ]
          },
          "411270405": {
            "id": "411270405",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Fatui this, Fatui that... So all of us are the bad guys now? What sort of logic is that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411270406"
            ]
          },
          "411270406": {
            "id": "411270406",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Well, whatever. Go out there and have a look. <color=#00E1FFFF>Come back and look for me if you really can't find it</color>.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411270407"
            ]
          },
          "411270407": {
            "id": "411270407",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "I'll give it a bit more thought. Maybe I'll remember something..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112705",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411270501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411270501": {
            "id": "411270501",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What happened while you were running back here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411270502"
            ]
          },
          "411270502": {
            "id": "411270502",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "While I was running back? Hmm, let's see... No, I can't recall any details.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411270503"
            ]
          },
          "411270503": {
            "id": "411270503",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Ah, yes! I did encounter a large group of Electro Slimes near the <color=#00E1FFFF>Thousand Winds Temple</color> on the way back. They gave me a few hard knocks, causing the box to fall out!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411270504"
            ]
          },
          "411270504": {
            "id": "411270504",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Now, I did manage to grab it back, but... I wound up losing it again in my haste.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411270505"
            ]
          },
          "411270505": {
            "id": "411270505",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Still, since the box was touched by those Electro Slimes, it should have some <color=#00E1FFFF>elemental traces</color> on it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411270506"
            ]
          },
          "411270506": {
            "id": "411270506",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "In any case, try following the trail of Electro traces and see what you can find.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411270507"
            ]
          },
          "411270507": {
            "id": "411270507",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Once you've found the box, bring it back to me."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112703",
      "subQuestName": "Use Elemental Sight to find the lost box",
